    "prompt_settings": {
      "value": "原论文用双向RNN/LSTM序列到程序、OpenNMT，编码/解码各2层、hidden size=100、Adam lr=0.001；MathQA beam=100，AQuA beam=200。研究LLM结果须另记提示协议。",
